so I'm gonna give you that.

00:04:59.219 --> 00:05:03.122
Listen, spoken like a real
salesman and I'm a real salesman.

00:05:03.122 --> 00:05:05.766
I'm a real salesman but you're not wrong,

00:05:05.766 --> 00:05:09.333
I'm all about the CTR,
right, the call to action,

00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:13.455
I'm into that, right, but
at the end of the day,

00:05:13.455 --> 00:05:15.044
you're talking about the difference

00:05:15.044 --> 00:05:17.722
between salesmanship and branding.

00:05:17.722 --> 00:05:19.892
Anybody can be a good salesman,

00:05:19.892 --> 00:05:23.126
but being a great brander,
that's where it gets going.

00:05:23.126 --> 00:05:27.250
The lift of being a brand,
being a Nike, being a Puma

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:31.084
versus just selling a new
sneaker, that's a big difference

00:05:31.084 --> 00:05:33.408
and so, tactically you're correct

00:05:33.408 --> 00:05:35.246
and I'm sure a lot of
people who watch this

00:05:35.246 --> 00:05:37.167
think about those things where,

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:38.870
"Why didn't Gary create
a call to action?",

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.207
"Why doesn't he have a pop
up when I land on his website

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:42.268
"to collect my email?",

00:05:42.268 --> 00:05:44.524
