as many other people do.

00:05:44.524 --> 00:05:48.316
The reason, at times, I don't
do it, 'cause at times I do,

00:05:48.316 --> 00:05:51.547
and at times, I'm very comfortable
throwing the right hook

00:05:51.547 --> 00:05:53.495
is because I do believe in the jam,

00:05:53.495 --> 00:05:55.473
the jab, not the jam, and the jam.

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:57.733
I believe that branding matters.

00:05:57.733 --> 00:05:59.681
I believe that there's a time and a place.

00:05:59.681 --> 00:06:00.935
I believe there's context.

00:06:00.935 --> 00:06:05.476
In this setting, yes, I do
think that in a 2015 world,

00:06:05.476 --> 00:06:08.235
