00:06:19.769 --> 00:06:22.083
And I do believe that when
somebody stumbles across this,

00:06:22.083 --> 00:06:25.203
yes, there could be a call
to action, and they can click

00:06:25.203 --> 00:06:27.603
and they can buy, but by
me asking for something

00:06:27.603 --> 00:06:30.386
like sign up for this or
buy that in this video

00:06:30.386 --> 00:06:34.092
or in this world of YouTube,
I'm also leaving a way,

00:06:34.092 --> 00:06:37.101
