can then look at my name,

00:06:37.101 --> 00:06:40.587
find this interesting,
control copy it, go to Google,

00:06:40.587 --> 00:06:43.121
search my name, go down a rabbit hole

00:06:43.121 --> 00:06:46.073
and let me build brand, because I asked,

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.193
like everybody else out
there, for the quick sale

00:06:49.193 --> 00:06:51.593
in this context, and
I took away the chance

00:06:51.593 --> 00:06:55.423
for us to kinda, you know,
it's kinda like relationships.

00:06:55.436 --> 00:06:58.946
Because I went to sleep with
that person on the first night,

00:06:58.946 --> 00:07:02.344
maybe I took away the chance
for us to get married.

00:07:02.738 --> 00:07:04.744
I, my friend, am playing the long game,

00:07:04.744 --> 00:07:06.217
the depth game, not the width game.

00:07:06.217 --> 00:07:09.783
So there's a time and place
for a call to action, a CTA

00:07:09.783 --> 00:07:14.492
but that isn't every single
at bat, every single time,

00:07:14.492 --> 00:07:17.604
every single channel,
because then you just become

00:07:17.604 --> 00:07:20.028
